"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Breweries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cideries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Coffee & Tea","historical_business_count":1}],"history":[{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ogS8iBWPsN0BsaTjYqXMew","review_id":"G_I1rodH0FJRx3MIfIpF5g","date":"2019-10-04T02:09:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9518879055976868,"text_excerpt":"Seriously just happened upon this place headed to visit Roulaison Distilling Co and Piety and Desire Chocolate. They are all in a neat little center on Broad Street. But back to the cider, these are for real ciders not sweet nonsense. So so very tasty in a warm atmosphere. Flights are available and I recommend trying them ALL! There was not one cider my group would not drink again. Small patio out back. Parking lot out back and street parking. Several events posted inside, like trivia nights and cheese pairings. Def headed back here ASAP!"},{"business_id":"ogS8iBWPsN0BsaTjYqXMew","review_id":"K7bJOUdLj60bGM-Sad-UAQ","date":"2017-09-22T22:37:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9494242072105408,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome. About time I get a chance to enjoy a range of Ciders. I live for Ciders!!! I am so for this place....I love the cider options. Especially sweet cider options! There are board games here to do things and enjoy. The more the merrier. The bartenders here are pretty cool. It is so fun. The environment Is really laid back and eccentric. There's a couch and that bad boy is so comfy. The prices are way reasonable and there are souvenir Go cups that looks like peroxide jars. It is incredible and. Heck this place out!"},{"business_id":"ogS8iBWPsN0BsaTjYqXMew","review_id":"CnZ26EhS2Z_RRwSJ2zPKEg","date":"2017-08-31T19:26:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9467151761054993,"text_excerpt":"So excited to finally have a cider bar in town! They brew their own cider so you can try a local cider, or enjoy one of the guest ciders they have on tap. There are plenty of places to sit inside and a lovely patio out back to enjoy when the weather allows. Definitely going to be a regular here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ogS8iBWPsN0BsaTjYqXMew","photo_id":"E9I6Q0fNfVuuTRNNcGnEZA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/E9I6Q0fNfVuuTRNNcGnEZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
